        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The maps below show the changes in the art gallery ground floor in 2015 and present day. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The maps below show the changes in the art gallery ground floor in 2015 and present day. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>&nbsp;IELTS Writing Task&nbsp; 1 - Art Gallery Ground Floor: 2015 vs Today</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i Art Gallery Ground Floor: 2015 vs Today y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về bố cục tầng trệt của một ph&ograve;ng trưng b&agrave;y nghệ thuật từ năm 2005 đến nay.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Art Gallery Ground Floor: 2015 vs Today với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: bố cục tầng trệt của một ph&ograve;ng trưng b&agrave;y nghệ thuật - từ năm 2005 đến nay.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-URUgdOFlfoTLuOx4fhol6qV1gQ3\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U2X3dVPT9ovlPbxnKGVlh3ndguf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>những thay đổi đ&aacute;ng kể nhất đ&atilde; diễn ra ở ph&iacute;a b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i của t&ograve;a nh&agrave;, nơi c&aacute;c kh&ocirc;ng gian được thiết kế lại để <em>n&acirc;ng cao trải nghiệm của kh&aacute;ch tham quan (enhance visitor experience).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IvOtdJWWooI3aFxyRSMlEehBgLh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>c&aacute;c tiện &iacute;ch mới đ&atilde; được bổ sung để <em>phục vụ c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m cụ thể (accommodate specific groups)</em>, với một khu vực d&agrave;nh ri&ecirc;ng cho trẻ em thay thế qu&aacute;n c&agrave; ph&ecirc; trước đ&acirc;y, c&ugrave;ng với <em>c&aacute;c cải tiến về khả năng tiếp cận khu vực (accessibility improvements)</em> bao gồm thang m&aacute;y v&agrave; lối đi d&agrave;nh cho xe lăn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c sự thay đổi dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; <strong>về mặt địa l&yacute;</strong>:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BgHSd2dTeomakhx6OoxlhVwogvg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Khu vực b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAFrds4TtoPHPjxh4OnlHmgUg8c\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gx0udTLlgo6V0UxOEXqlss4tg8f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>qu&aacute;n c&agrave; ph&ecirc; (cafe)</strong>, đ&atilde; từng <em>nằm (be located)</em> ở g&oacute;c tr&ecirc;n b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i v&agrave;o năm 2005, đ&atilde; ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n được thay thế bởi <strong>văn ph&ograve;ng ph&ograve;ng trưng b&agrave;y (gallery office)</strong>, vốn được chuyển từ vị tr&iacute; trung t&acirc;m b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i sang vị tr&iacute; n&agrave;y.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYUzdHE5kojHwlxhmijlDNIogVc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) Kh&ocirc;ng gian văn ph&ograve;ng ph&ograve;ng trưng b&agrave;y ban đầu giờ đ&acirc;y được sử dụng cho <strong>một m&aacute;y b&aacute;n h&agrave;ng tự động (vending machine)</strong>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W47qdWaTEoBJa1x4JnmlZEjJgbe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>ph&ograve;ng triển l&atilde;m số 4 (exhition room 4)</strong>, nằm ở g&oacute;c dưới b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i v&agrave;o năm 2005, đ&atilde; bị loại bỏ <em>để nhường chỗ cho (make room for)</em> một khu vực d&agrave;nh cho trẻ em.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Khu vực c&ograve;n lại</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HUqOdarQwow7hQxpsnulpYNmgGe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y7iEdiO8toRyq0xWEqal0a9cgoI\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>c&aacute;c ph&ograve;ng triển l&atilde;m 1, 2 v&agrave; 3 (exhibition rooms 1,2, and 3)</strong> <em>vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; ban đầu (maintain their original positions)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UJYgdsIbYo47Quxl31blzahKg5c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>cầu thang (stairs) </strong>đ&atilde; được dịch chuyển nhẹ sang b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i để bố tr&iacute; lắp đặt <strong>thang m&aacute;y mới (new lift)</strong>, trong khi <strong>khu vực lễ t&acirc;n (receptionist)</strong> đ&atilde; được di dời gần hơn đến lối v&agrave;o <em>để hỗ trợ kh&aacute;ch tham quan tốt hơn (for better visitor assistance).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cze0dqlU4oXUUGx7wFRlsqi6g2e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 3) <strong>một lối đi d&agrave;nh cho xe lăn (a wheelchair champ)</strong> đ&atilde; được th&ecirc;m v&agrave;o tại lối v&agrave;o ch&iacute;nh để khu vực n&agrave;y dễ tiếp cận hơn đối với <em>kh&aacute;ch tham quan khuyết tật (visitors with disabilities).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1648,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PTc7dGTAKou6bBxrcMklWQtLg3e\">The maps illustrate the modifications made to the ground floor layout of an art gallery between 2005 and the present day.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18142,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1649,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YFUsdHLIjojDggxnd8xlmLcUgff\">Overall, the most significant changes have occurred on the left side of the building, where spaces have been redesigned to enhance visitor experience. Notably, new facilities have been added to accommodate specific groups, with a dedicated children's area replacing the former cafe, and accessibility improvements including a lift and wheelchair ramp.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18142,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1650,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WHlZdcbzDoHgnHxxavzlkuLOgog\">Looking at the left side of the gallery, the cafe, which used to be located in the top left corner in 2005, has been completely replaced by the gallery office, which has been relocated from the center-left to this position. The original gallery office space is now occupied by a vending machine. Furthermore, exhibition room 4, located at the bottom left in 2005, has been eliminated to make room for a children's area.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18142,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1651,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dp7BdmeMgosXjnxULABlIthCgKf\">Regarding the right side and central areas, exhibition rooms 1, 2, and 3 have maintained their original positions. However, several modifications have been made to improve functionality: the stairs have been shifted slightly to the left to accommodate a new lift installation, while the receptionist area has been repositioned closer to the entrance for better visitor assistance. In addition, a wheelchair ramp has been added at the main entrance to make the area more accessible for visitors with disabilities.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18142,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
